      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SLICK BADGER (1) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Grade 4/5 winner three back (25.36) at Ballarat over 450m. Can turn form around here. JETTY JUMPER (7) ran below his best last time finishing eighth (30.92) over 525m at this track in a Grade 5. Form here sound including three wins. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. Warrants plenty of respect. PETALI (8) has a strong record this trip with three wins and two placings from nine starts. In the money last time at this track (30.47) in a Restricted WIN, finishing a 5.5 lengths second. Looks well placed here and among the chances. PAW ZHANA (6) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
